Business Segments

We operate in a single reportable segment, which includes all activities related to the development of our lead product candidate, ONP-002, for the treatment of mild traumatic brain injury (concussion). This determination is consistent with how financial information is reviewed and evaluated by our Chief Executive Officer (“CEO”) and Chief Financial Officer (“CFO”) for purposes of performance assessment, resource allocation, and planning.

